# Personal context

Last reviewed: YYYY-MM-DD

## Goals

Record each goal with status (proposed, active, achieved, retired), date, target, rationale, and optional deadline or success measure. Keep targets separate from observations.

## Constraints

Record medical restrictions, symptom triggers, fixed commitments, and practical limits.

## Preferences

Record food, exercise, communication, and treatment preferences.

## Priorities and tradeoffs

Record what matters most and acceptable effort, cost, or time commitments.

## Other context

Record relevant information not captured elsewhere, with dates and attribution when useful. An empty section means unspecified, not no constraints.
